<title>BELGIUM: EU to open German barley intervention tender.</title>
<headline>EU to open German barley intervention tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union agreed &quot;in principle&quot; on Thursday to open a German intervention barley export tender, Commission sources said.</p>
<p>There was no decision on quantity or dates.</p>
<p>The outline decision was taken at a cereals management committee meeting which also agreed to open wheat, barley and rye tenders for export from the free market starting on July 17.</p>
</text>
